{"id":"vod_sn_39014","vodId":"39014","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"ZETMAN 超魔人","name_cn":"ZETMAN 超魔人","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/107b96c81e4c04b71a90197a60829eef.jpg"},"summary":"《zetman 超魔人》是2012年出品的一部日本动漫，导演是锅岛修。人类的存亡被托付给了“ZET”，追求正义最终意义的“ALPHAS”，两股意识正在默默的改变着这个世界！主角阿人是一名体内隐藏着神秘力量ZET的、外形酷似蝙蝠侠的神秘少年。作为实验室人造人而诞生的阿人，起初并不能理解人类的情感，但在“爷爷”（参与制造人造人实验的博士）的教导之下，他学习并慢慢体会到了人类的感情。在怪异事件频频发生的情况下，一名神秘老人开始寻找阿人的下落。一天，阿人突然遇上了异形杀人魔，于是安稳的生活发生了巨大的变化。面对超越人类智能的杀人魔的力量，阿人会怎么办呢？这个体内隐藏着神秘力量的少年阿人，他会成为英雄还是恶魔？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XMtHJZ6Aac1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fn379yDEcC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YTAuFigL5x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GTd5zS1c2r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VK9WstR0bj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VzxpRmWiLn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NFgL5c2AQh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/imxrmAvjuE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zN8LqRKPmZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CJkq80RJsF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sgmvLBbe9k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gZpdk0q7Ct1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MEDvQLPZJA1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.647Z"}